</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Saved from our sin at this fountain, we</l><l>Fully enjoy our redemption free;</l><l>This we’ll enjoy for eternity,</l><l>Glory to His name!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now both redemption and life we share,</l><l>Cleansed in His blood, we’re abiding there</l><l>Drinking the water of life fore’er;</l><l>Glory to His name!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
